  "Cases for what a reader draws while its acts have not reached the data (SPEC.md section 5, \"What is drawn while it waits\"). One file, read by the renderer's test (test/pendingvectors.test.js) and copyable by any other reader, to run the same cases against its own withPending and rowIds.",
  "The expected answers were made by running the Booklet plugin for Obsidian's own code (core/rows-act.ts: withPending and rowIds).",
